Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.55,0:22:54.23,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}No matter how steep or far the road is
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:58.52,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I will not give up
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.69,0:23:07.37,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Endless tears flowing down my cheek are not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.37,0:23:12.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}A white flag of surrender
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.66,0:23:24.38,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}I go and become the wings of a loved one
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.47,0:23:28.76,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}Gather up the shattered dream
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.76,0:23:34.39,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}And take it to the end of the universe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.39,0:23:37.35,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.35,0:23:39.86,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Row strongly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:46.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}And hold your thoughts close to your chest
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.57,0:23:50.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.45,0:23:54.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Through your despair
